   Minist Educ},
Abstract = {This paper mainly introduces the design of a Data Presenting and
   Analysis System Based on NET This system provides us a platform with the
   functions like data analysis on the data in Child Emotion Development
   Database, including Descriptive, One-Sample T-test, Independent-Samples
   T test, Correlate, and Frequencies. The results will be presented in the
   form of a graphic or a list. Besides, the results can be exported in
   Excel. The database of Child Development has been constructed.
   This paper firstly introduces some backgrounds about the project, and
   main work of the author. Secondly, a brief introduction of the demand
   and design for the software systems is been presented. Then the main
   functions and the major modules of the system have been listed Finally
   the theory knowledge about the analysis method has been described in
   detail, at the same time some examples with interfaces and flow charts
   are given.},
