   Catania (Sicily, Italy) has been carried out. The area covers the
   central city (Catania) and a number of smaller centers (villages)
   connected by territorial contiguity of close integration with regard to
   economic activity, environmental, vital services for social and cultural
   relations. The component of alien species was compared to that of native
   ones, considering the historical and spatial aspects, and the role and
   presence of the non-native plants in natural habitats. Furthermore,
