Abstract = {This study lasted 18 weeks and there were 61 college students of weak
   physical health as the subjects of the research. By the contrast
   experiment, we got the result of the analysis of the transformation of
   the body configuration, the physical function, the physical quality and
   the psychological stress level of the students with weak physical health
   after they take the health preservation exercise. It shows that: 1) the
   health preservation exercise is fit for the college students with weak
   health; 2) the effect of the health preservation exercise to the body
   configuration, the physical function and the physical quality of the
   students with weak physical health is remarkable; 3) the psychological
   stress level is remarkably improved.},
