   development and environmental protection in rural or urban. Exploring
   coliquefaction of coal with biomass, it was a new thinking of harmonious
   development about energy development with environmental protection, and
   there is an important significance for the establishment of
   energy-saving and environment-friendly society from coliquefaction.
