Organization = {Guangdong Univ Business Studies},
Abstract = {The research was the character of the urban sludge burning with coal by
   using the elemental anaylsis, component analysis, proximate analysis and
   thermogravimetric analysis. There is a big different elemental
   composition between the urban sludge and coal. For example, the carbon
   content (20.64\%) in the sludge is only 31.3\% of the coal. SiO2 in
   sludge incineration ash contain up to 15\%, the same as SiO2 in
   Siliceous clinker. The sludge ash content (56.46\%) is 2 times of in
   coal ash, and the volatile of sludge (34.6377\%)is higher than the
   volatile of coal (25.089\%), the sludge incineration can be divided into
   three stages: moisture volatilizing stage (30 degrees C to 160 degrees
   C), devolatilization combustion stage (160 degrees C to 500 degrees C)
   and fixed carbon and residual combustibles burning stage (510 degrees C
   to 950 degrees C). The heating rate increased, the volatiles volatilized
   advance about 50 degrees C. Therefore, the sludge is a high value fuel,
   which can be used in the burning with coal or building materials.},
