   Beijing Univ Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {Fire station is an important urban public infrastructure. The
   distribution of fire station is very important, which has always been
   the focus of planners. However, in most of China, the distribution of
   the fire stations is unreasonable, cannot meet the needs of today's
   disaster prevention. Based on the GIS technology and the ideas of
   scenario planning, with the use of three planning methods (traditional
   fire stations' distribution, LA model optimization method, method based
   on fire risk assessment of city fire), this paper builds up the
   optimization scenario of fire station of Fuzhou City and draws a
   comparison of analysis result and current situation by multiple
   indicators. Afterwards, by the means of the problems in Fuzhou fire
   stations' distribution are sorted out and scientific support is provided
   for the fire station planning.},
